      <p>Stickers and product packaging labels in Dubai face environmental challenges rarely encountered in other markets: ambient temperatures reaching 50&deg;C, intense ultraviolet (UV) radiation index levels of 11+, high coastal humidity in Dubai Marina and JBR, and extreme condensation cycles when refrigerated bottles are brought outdoors. Selecting an improper substrate leads to curling edges, adhesive failure, and blurred ink.</p>

